Hi @crkco,

I guess the issue you are facing is related to the chosen clock prerescaler value. In fact, in the LPUART case, fCK must range from 
  **3 x baudrate** to **4096 x baudrate**,  a check is thus performed in the UART_SetConfig() to verify this value.

